# Extension rules

- TypeScript. `vscode` API. Lazy `activationEvents`.
- Cursor installs from Open VSX. Package for that.
- Tokens in SecretStorage, never in `contributes.configuration` defaults.
- Same publisher.extension ID if dual-publishing.
- Do not assume Microsoft Marketplace availability equals Cursor availability.
